		<div class="plate-grid">
			<div class="legend">
				<h1 id="plate-1">Check every reference before a reviewer does.</h1>
				<p class="lead">Starbuck reads a manuscript and its reference list, and looks up each cited work in Crossref, PubMed, OpenAlex and other public records. It tells you which references do not exist, which point to a different paper, which have a wrong year or author, and which cite a retracted work. It proposes the corrections as a diff.</p>

