						<pre class="cmd"><code>uv tool install starbuck</code></pre>
						<p>Then <code>starbuck check paper.docx</code>. Needs <a href="https://docs.astral.sh/uv/" rel="noopener">uv</a>; Python 3.11 or later comes with it. <a href="/guide/">Guide</a>.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="install-panel" role="tabpanel" id="panel-pipx" aria-labelledby="tab-pipx" hidden>
