				<p class="hero-alt">Word, LaTeX, Markdown and Quarto. Zotero, Mendeley and EndNote citations in Word are read directly. <a href="/how-it-checks/">How it checks</a> · <a href="/validation/">How well it checks</a></p>
				<p class="newcomer sibling">Starbuck is the reference checker of <a href="{{ site.subsub }}">Sub-Sub</a>, the research assistant for Zotero. It also works on its own: in the terminal, in a GitHub Action, or from any AI agent.</p>
